{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And they said: May YHWH look upon you.</b> You have made us stink, which is upon you." "Know that the five senses unite in one place, above the forehead. Therefore they say one sense beneath its fellow, as in וּמָתוֹק הָאוֹר (Ecclesiastes 11:7). And Rabbi Marinus said that we are loathsome and foul in His eyes like a bad odor."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:31:59.710730044Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}